{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_72","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/sh -lc \"/tmp/apply_patch <<'PATCH'\n*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: paper.tex\n@@\n-\\\\input{supplementary_rows.tex}\n+German & Logistic & 7301 & 0.8811 & 0.9163 & 0.7680 \\\\\\\\\n+German & Forest & 7301 & 0.8276 & 0.8728 & 0.7440 \\\\\\\\\n+German & Boosting & 7301 & 0.8113 & 0.8392 & 0.7200 \\\\\\\\\n+ACSIncome & Logistic & 7301 & 0.9528 & 0.9803 & 0.8103 \\\\\\\\\n+ACSIncome & Forest & 7301 & 0.9795 & 0.9781 & 0.7730 \\\\\\\\\n+ACSIncome & Boosting & 7301 & 0.9567 & 0.9571 & 0.7880 \\\\\\\\\n+German & Logistic & 9109 & 0.8742 & 0.9117 & 0.7680 \\\\\\\\\n+German & Forest & 9109 & 0.8076 & 0.8588 & 0.7600 \\\\\\\\\n+German & Boosting & 9109 & 0.7962 & 0.8311 & 0.7200 \\\\\\\\\n+ACSIncome & Logistic & 9109 & 0.9511 & 0.9740 & 0.8103 \\\\\\\\\n+ACSIncome & Forest & 9109 & 0.9744 & 0.9690 & 0.7670 \\\\\\\\\n+ACSIncome & Boosting & 9109 & 0.9666 & 0.9768 & 0.7880 \\\\\\\\\n*** End Patch\nPATCH\nmkdir -p /tmp/poppler-tools\ncd /tmp/poppler-tools && apt-get download poppler-utils > /tmp/poppler-download.log 2>&1; cat /tmp/poppler-download.log; for file in /tmp/poppler-tools/*.deb; do if [ -f \\\"\"'$file\" ]; then dpkg-deb -x \"$file\" /tmp/poppler-tools/extracted; fi; done\nldd /tmp/poppler-tools/extracted/usr/bin/pdftotext 2>/dev/null | head -20'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
